126
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,960
It 's half my car . I helped pay for it and I mean to take it .

127
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,760
We don 't know where you 're going .

128
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:13,600
You haven 't seen fit to tell us anything , have you ?

129
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,360
No , you may not have the car .

130
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:18,040
What beats me is why you 're playing this thing so cozy ...

131
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,400
like this was a jailbreak .

132
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:23,400
In any case , I 'm sure I 'm doing what Mother would have thought best .

133
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:27,320
Although I don 't suppose poor Mother 's wishes mean much to you .

134
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:30,480
Get out . Get out , both of you .

135
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:34,680
Now just a minute , young lady . You happen to be in my living room .

136
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:38,440
I happen to be in my bedroom , and I pay a good part of your rent for it .

137
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:41,880
Now get out before I show you what my nerves can really do !

138
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:48,440
Besides , how do I know you 'll bring back my car in good condition ?

139
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,720
Come on .

140
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:13,400
I want my car . I mean to take it .

141
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:15,560
- Which ? - The Fredericks ' car .

142
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:22,320
- You ain 't Mrs. Fredericks . - It 's half mine .

143
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:24,600
- Who are you ? - Her sister , Miss Lance .

144
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:28,160
Look , here 's my driver 's license ...

145
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,960
here 's my library card ...

146
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:33,680
and here 's a blood donor card .

147
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:38,320
All the same address as my sister 's . I live with her .

148
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:41,680
- Front row , left of the far pillar . - Thank you .

149
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:01,040
" Very happy that you 'll be joining us in Hill House .

150
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:03,240
" Take US 50 from Boston ...

151
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:06,120
" and watch for the turnoff onto Route 238 . "

152
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:10,680
Route 238 .

153
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:14,200
At last I am going someplace where I 'm expected ...

154
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,400
and where I 'm being given shelter .

155
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:18,880
And I shall never have to come back .

156
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:21,440
I hope ...

157
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:24,240
This is what I 've been waiting for all my life .

158
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:29,280
I 'm going . I 'm really going .

159
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,760
I 've finally taken a step .

160
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:42,800
By now they know the car is gone ...

161
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,440
but they don 't know where .

162
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:48,800
They would never have suspected it of me .

163
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:52,040
I would never have suspected it of myself .

164
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,080
I 'm a new person .

165
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:11,920
Someday ...

166
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,680
Someday I 'll have an apartment of my own ...

167
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:19,840
in a house with a pair of stone lions guarding the gate .

168
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:24,760
I might just stop anywhere and never leave again .

169
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,400
Or I might drive on and on ...

170
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:30,200
until the wheels of the car are worn to nothing ...

171
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:33,240
and I 've come to the end of the world .

172
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:36,960
I wonder if all homeless people feel that way .

173
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:40,800
I wonder what Dr. Markway is like .

174
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:44,040
I wonder who else will be there .

175
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:47,360
I wonder what Hill House is like .

176
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:20,280
- What do you want ? - I want to come in , please .

177
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:23,240
- Please unlock the gates . - Who says ?

178
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:26,920
I 'm supposed to come in . I 'm expected .

179
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:29,040
- Who by ? - Dr. Markway .

180
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:32,040
- You better come back later . - Please .

181
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,760
I 'm one of Dr. Markway 's guests .

182
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:36,680
He 's expecting me in the house . Please listen to me .

183
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:38,560
He can 't rightly be expecting you ...

184
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:41,400
