185
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:44,760
Do you mean that there 's no one in the house ?

186
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,520
No one you 'd want to see .

187
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:51,520
- What did you say your name was ? - Eleanor Lance ...

188
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:53,600
and I am expected in Hill House .

189
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:56,280
- Unlock those gates at once . - All right .

190
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:02,680
Suppose you know what you 're asking for coming here .

191
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:05,320
Suppose they told you , back in the city .

192
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:25,400
You seem to be the one who 's afraid .

193
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:28,600
You 'll be sorry I ever opened the gate .

194
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:31,480
Out of the way , please . You 've held me up long enough .

195
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:34,360
- Are you Dudley , the caretaker ? - I 'm Dudley , the caretaker .

196
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:35,920
I shall report you .

197
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:38,120
Think they can find anyone else to stay here ?

198
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:41,080
Think we can 't have things the way we want , me and the wife ...

199
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:43,320
as long as we stay around here , see to the house ...

200
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:46,320
for all you city people think you know everything ?

201
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:26,160
It 's staring at me .

202
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,400
Vile .

203
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:34,360
Get away from here . Get away at once .

204
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:38,800
It 's my chance . I 'm being given a last chance .

205
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:41,320
I could turn my car around and go away from here ...

206
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:44,720
and no one would blame me . Anyone has a right to run away .

207
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:48,240
But you are running away , Eleanor ...

208
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:50,800
and there 's nowhere else to go .

209
00:17:31,760 --> 00:17:33,200
It 's waiting for me .

210
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:36,520
Evil , patient ...

211
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:38,160
waiting .

212
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:01,080
Mrs. Dudley ?

213
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:04,720
I 'm Eleanor Lance . I 'm expected .

214
00:18:34,040 --> 00:18:36,040
Can you take me to my room ?

215
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:52,600
I gather I 'm the first one here , Mrs. Dudley .

216
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:56,360
You did say you were Mrs. Dudley ? I met your ...

217
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:06,600
Talk about being scared of your own shadow .

218
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:08,920
Pull yourself together .

219
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,040
Here .

220
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:22,600
This is your room .

221
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,440
How nice .

222
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:28,160
I can 't keep the rooms the way I 'd like ...

223
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:31,360
